  "plot": "Jericho Cane, a grieving ex-detective haunted by his family's murder, works private security in New York City. His life destabilizes when he identifies a banker as a demonic vessel seeking a young woman, Christine York, to birth the Antichrist before the year 2000. While Vatican factions clash over whether to protect or execute York, Cane finds himself the unlikely barrier between her and a supernatural force. Surrounded by betrayal and supernatural manipulation, Cane must confront his own nihilism and faith. As the final hour approaches, he struggles to retain his autonomy against an entity that weaponizes his trauma, eventually forcing him to decide between his survival and the survival of the world.",
  "simplePlot": "Jericho Cane, a grieving ex-detective haunted by his family's murder, works private security in New York City. His life destabilizes when he identifies a banker as a demonic vessel seeking a young woman, Christine York, to birth the Antichrist before the year 2000. While Vatican factions clash over whether to protect or execute York, Cane finds himself the unlikely barrier between her and a supernatural force. Surrounded by betrayal and supernatural manipulation, Cane must confront his own nihilism and faith. As the final hour approaches, he struggles to retain his autonomy against an entity that weaponizes his trauma, eventually forcing him to decide between his survival and the survival of the world.",
